# Monocypher SOUP Record — IEC 62304 §8.1.2

Library:   Monocypher
Version:   4.0.2
Source:    https://github.com/LoupVaillant/Monocypher/tree/4.0.2
Tag:       4.0.2
License:   BSD-2-Clause OR CC0-1.0

Files vendored from firmware/crypto/vendor/monocypher/:
  monocypher.h              — src/monocypher.h
  monocypher.c              — src/monocypher.c
  monocypher-ed25519.h      — src/optional/monocypher-ed25519.h
  monocypher-ed25519.c      — src/optional/monocypher-ed25519.c

Note: All four files contain "version __git__" in their header comment.
This is normal Monocypher upstream behaviour — the __git__ placeholder is
present in every commit including tagged releases; the canonical version
identifier is the git tag above, not the in-source string.

Usage in NeuroPulse:
  monocypher.c + monocypher-ed25519.c are compiled into the np_crypto
  static library.  Only crypto_ed25519_check (RFC 8032, SHA-512) is called
  from NeuroPulse first-party code.  MISRA C:2012 scans target src/np_crypto.c
  only; SOUP files are exempt per IEC 62304 §8.1.2 with documented origin.
